    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the way you put that... \"letting go of the effort...\" it's almost like it sounds peaceful when you say it. like there's no point in trying to patch up a building that's already collapsed. is that actually a real option? just to stop trying to find meaning where there isn't any?",
